 "notes": "Replaced the Riot (37) and Valve (17) skin SKU lists with archetypes: Dragon Lore, Prime and Reaver for weapon skins; Karambit and M9 Bayonet finish families for knives. Short m and r ranges kept. CS2 glove models taken in as their own kind. Howl, Asiimov, Fade (rifle), Doppler (rifle), Medusa, Elderflame, Oni, Glitchpop, Kuronami and RGX 11z Pro as archetypes dropped: no retrieved page named them (Valorant fandom pages gave 402 on WebFetch; Prime and Reaver established via the Firecrawl retry, others not). Fortnite pickaxes and Rocket League cars are broad archetypes without named items; licensed crossover cars left out because they carry film titles. Vehicle skin and Wrap keep the old Epic help source. | Deepening pass: added archetypes M4A4 Howl, AWP Asiimov, Valorant Elderflame, Oni, Glitchpop, Kuronami, and Rocket League Dominus (Vehicle skin) from fetched pages; no models trimmed. Valorant pages came from news sites (gameinformer, ggrecon, upcomer, thespike) since fandom pages were blocked. Oni details are for the 2.0 line only; Howl page gives no collection or year."
